diff --git a/CHANGES.md b/CHANGES.md
index 483f089..ca94637 100644
--- a/CHANGES.md
+++ b/CHANGES.md
@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@
 ## 1.22.1 (PENDING)
 
 ### Bug Fixes
+* In the CSS attribute selectors (`=`, `^=`, `$=`, `*=`), a quoted value was incorrectly trimmed, so `[xxx*=" paywalled "]` would match `xxx="xpaywalled"`. Quoted values now preserve their whitespace, and empty values such as `[data='']` are accepted.
 * Previously cached child Elements of an Element were not correctly invalidated in `Node#replaceWith(Node)`, which could lead to incorrect results when subsequently calling `Element#children()`. [#2391](https://github.com/jhy/jsoup/issues/2391)
 
 
